am/apps/2493930/extras/229751d40fd73166d5fc8ee4d9519afa.avif?t=1721964410\" /></span><br>- 30k words of story;<br><br>- Story with choices that affect how it unfolds later on;<br><br>- Characters with unique personalities and motivations;<br><br>- A narrative that mixes romance and fantasy adventure;<br><br>- Multiple endings;<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2493930/extras/a8313df1f03b577a324598e2f2028219.avif?t=1721964410\" /></span><br>Screenplay, artwork and development: B.G. Riccetto<br><br>General (and emotional) support: M.Graymoon<br><br>Backgrounds: Original VN Maker and DLCs<br><br>Sounds and Musics: Original VN Maker, Tapatilorenzo, Dansevenstar, DJSound FX, Antumdeluge, Kenney and Kurt",
